[Mission.Objectives]
Liberate Mondrainville, press southward, secure the road to Caen, and eliminate all enemy strong points.
[Mission.Description]
Press forward, block the road to Caen, and clear the enemy from the area surrounding Mondrainville.
[Submission_01.Success]
Mondrainville captured.
[Submission_01.Failed]
